# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Open-source repo: track ONLY the runnable reference implementation.
# Everything else - Medium series drafts (docs/), internal notes, build
# artifacts - is ignored. Whitelist style: ignore all, then re-include code.
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

# 1) Ignore everything at the repo root by default.
/*

# 2) Re-include the implementation (and the files needed to run/build it).
!/agent_plane/
!/policies/
!/config/
!/tests/
!/spec/
!/sdk/
!/examples/
!/pyproject.toml
!/vercel.json
!/MANIFEST.in
!/README.md
!/INTEGRATION.md
!/Dockerfile.alpine
!/deploy/
!/console/
/console/node_modules/
!/EDGES.md
!/CONFIGURATION.md
!/ARCHITECTURE.md
!/LICENSE
!/CONTRIBUTING.md
!/SECURITY.md
!/CHANGELOG.md
!/Dockerfile
!/docker-compose.yml
!/.dockerignore
!/.env.example
!/.gitignore
!/.github/

# Public docs (docs/README.md, quickstart, integration guides, API reference,
# deployment) and the README hero asset; the Medium series and capstone drafts
# stay local.
!/docs/
/docs/*
!/docs/README.md
!/docs/quickstart.md
!/docs/api-reference.md
!/docs/deployment.md
!/docs/openapi.json
!/docs/integration/
!/docs/assets/
/docs/assets/*
!/docs/assets/hero.png
!/docs/assets/console-live.png

# Internal planning documents stay local, including within public directories.
ROADMAP.md
GATEWAY_PLAN.md
spec/authority-provenance.md
**/*PLAN*.md
**/*ROADMAP*.md
**/*plan*.md
**/*roadmap*.md

# 3) Strip build/runtime artifacts that live *inside* the re-included dirs.
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
*.egg-info/
.pytest_cache/
.env
audit.db
*.sqlite
.vercel
.env*
sdk/python/build/
sdk/python/dist/
sdk/typescript/dist/
node_modules/
.playwright-mcp/
.ruff_cache/
